Fix a false positive ``duplicate-bases`` in pylint for a class deriving from a
class that itself has several ``TypedDict`` bases. Every use of ``TypedDict``
used to be inferred to a distinct class, so the MRO of such a class held
several ``TypedDict`` entries and ``ClassDef.mro()`` raised
``DuplicateBasesError``. ``TypedDict`` is now inferred to a single class.

Closes pylint-dev/pylint#9222
